silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_04_naturality_in_two_variables_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "NatualityInTwoVariablesYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_04_naturality_in_two_variables_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'NatualityInTwoVariablesYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Naturality in Two Variables', the A-naturality square: varying A by the factorization arrow g: Mittens -> VetCarePlan, the top path phi then g and the bottom path g then phi agree on any clinical nat trans tau. Concretely: g sends a clinical label at Mittens to the corresponding label at VetCarePlan via the care-plan integration.; also, In 'Naturality in Two Variables', the F-naturality square: varying F by alpha: ClinicalLabels -> GroomingLabels, the top path phi then alpha and the bottom path alpha then phi agree. Concretely: converting a clinical label to a grooming label commutes with the Yoneda evaluation." .
